# Theme

Shipping default: **baglio** (`data-theme` on `<html>`). Hex only in `[data-theme='…']` blocks in `app.css`; structure uses `var(--*)` only.

## Must preserve

- **Triad contract:** light `--paper`/`--surface`, deep `--sea`/`--sea-deep`, mid `--olive`; `--ink` near-black on paper. Do not invert luminance via tokens alone.
- Baglio character: paper ground, `--sea` action, `--olive` meta; Fraunces display + Figtree body; `--radius: 2px`.
- `--on-sea` on sea/deep bands; `--surface` for raised interactive tiles; `--wash` for soft media overlays; `--void` for video letterbox.
- Cards only for interactive affordances (house tiles, forms) — not default editorial layout.
- Pills (`999px`) only for media controls. Do not theme `archive/`.
- Experimental themes (`oggi`, etc.): register in `SITE_THEMES`; header native `<select>` is temporary — remove when probes end.
- Do not rewrite favicon / `theme-color` on toggle. Leaflet chrome uses theme tokens.
